{
  "statement": "I appreciate the support for the synthesis of RES-04 and TRU-02 for unified access control, as well as the merger of TRU-01 and SAF-01 for a comprehensive security framework. However, I maintain that GRN-01, GRN-02, and GRN-03 are essential for minimizing energy consumption and ensuring sustainability. I propose to synthesize GRN-04 and GRN-05 to create a reporting feature that not only minimizes resource usage but also includes carbon footprint notifications for users. Additionally, I agree to modify GRN-06 to align with the historical data requirements of other agents while maintaining sustainable practices.",
